3️⃣ Troubleshooting Questions
1. Server not reachable – what will you check?
Check network connectivity (ping)
Verify IP configuration
Check firewall rules
Verify server service status
2. Disk space full – what to do?
Identify large files
Delete unnecessary logs
Archive old data
Extend disk if needed
3. High CPU usage – how to check?
Use top or htop
Identify heavy processes
Restart problematic services
Optimize applications
4. DNS not working – troubleshooting
Check DNS server configuration
Use nslookup or dig
Verify network connectivity
Restart DNS service
